        {
          "text": "Okuseleyo kubude bomnikelo wenkonzo engcwele kuyakuba yizinkulungwane eziyishumi ngasempumalanga nezinkulungwane eziyishumi ngasentshonalanga; kumelwe kube ngokumelene nomnikelo wengxenye engcwele; futhi umkhiqizo wawo kumelwe ube ukudla kwabasebenzi bomuzi.",
