          "text": "Wonke umnikelo wokudla uyakuba yizinkulungwane ezingamashumi amabili nanhlanu ubude nezinkulungwane ezingamashumi amabili nanhlanu; ninikele ngomnikelo ongcwele wokudla kanye nempahla yomuzi.",
