        {
          "text": "Okuseleyo kuyakuba ngeyesikhulu, ngalapha nangalapha komnikelo ongcwele nowefa lomuzi, izinkulungwane ezingamashumi amabili nanhlanu zomnikelo wokudla ngasemkhawulweni wasempumalanga nasentshonalanga ngasentshonalanga. Izinkulungwane ezingamashumi amabili nanhlanu ngasemngceleni osentshonalanga, ngokumelene nezindawo zesikhulu; kuyakuba ngumnikelo ongcwele wokudla; nendlu engcwele yendlu iyakuba phakathi kwawo.",
