        {
          "text": "Amasango omuzi ayakuba ngokwamagama ezizwe zakwa-Israyeli, amasango amathathu ngasenyakatho; elinye yisango lakwaRubeni, elinye yisango lakwaJuda, elinye yisango lakwaLevi.",
